  <trk>
    <name>Vikingaleden stage 7, Gimo to Österbybruk (corresponds to Upplandsleden stage 11)</name>
    <desc>This section goes between two beautiful industrial sites in Uppland. You hike through varied forest, over moss areas and mostly along trails. In this section you are in the middle of nature with all the forest animals.</desc>
